        "text": "<thinking> To create the embeddings_client.py file, I need to write the necessary Python code that includes the configuration and client helper utilities for the Direct Embeddings API. The code will import the required modules, set up the configuration, and define a client class for interacting with the API. </thinking>\n\n",
