    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `embed_for_search.py` that embeds a query and documents for semantic search using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which is a suitable choice for this task. I will import the necessary modules from the `boto3` library to interact with Amazon Bedrock and include the specific model identifier for the embedding task. </thinking>\n",
