    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To compute cosine similarity between two embedded texts, I will use the Hugging Face Transformers library, which is a concrete external provider. I will import the necessary modules and use a pre-trained model from Hugging Face to generate embeddings for the texts. Then, I will compute the cosine similarity between the embeddings. </thinking>\n",
